      "baseline_exemption": "Open Watcom portability fixes affecting every Open Watcom build: carry flag tested as zero/non-zero and AX=7100h treated as LFN failure. The upstream Open Watcom build loops forever on a DOS without LFN support (FreeDOS 1.4 FAT16 kernels, including the PC-88VA kernel); FreeDOS 1.4 shipped a Borland build, so no byte baseline exists. Checked by guest runs on PC (FAT32 and FAT16 FreeDOS 1.4 kernels) and VAEG.",
